      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining the Translation Approach**\n\nI'm solidifying the core architecture; I've decided to proceed with Google Cloud Translation API for the external translation service, making its integration a key element of the file. My focus has shifted from high-level markup to the integration plan for Google Cloud.\n\n\n**Establishing the Structure**\n\nMy current focus is on building the `translate_markup.py` file and establishing its core functions. I am now working on a function that will receive the markup to be translated, along with source and target languages. I plan to call the `translate_html` method from the `google-cloud-translate` library to accomplish the translations, and am preparing the code structure.\n\n\n",
