      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining Translation Provider**\n\nI've decided to use the Google Cloud Translation API for the `batch_translate.py` script. The next step is coding this provider selection into the script and making it easily identifiable. I think this will work well for our user's translation needs, which include preserving order.\n\n\n**Implementing Translation Logic**\n\nI've outlined the core translation logic, now focused on the specifics. I'm importing the Google Cloud Translation API library and crafting a function. This function will take the list of strings, along with the source and target languages, and interface with the API. The `translate_text` method will be the crucial piece, ensuring the strings are translated and the output maintains their initial sequence.\n\n\n",
