    {
      "data": {
        "text": "**Choosing Translation Provider**\n\nI've decided to move forward with Google Cloud Translation as the external translation service for `translate_text.py`. I want this choice to be evident in the code, for ease of use.\n\n\n**Defining the Structure**\n\nOkay, I'm setting up the core structure. The `translate_text.py` file is being built now. I'm focusing on defining a function that takes the text, source, and target languages as inputs. I'm aiming for a straightforward implementation using the Google Cloud Translation API.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789820207827,
          "start": 1789820206349
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0b998fd0d001l2NqsD0Ku8Djhu",
